    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C03"],
      "claim": "Hydroxyzine, a lipophilic piperazine CNS-active drug, readily crosses the BBB and is not subject to P-gp efflux, supporting that lipophilic piperidine/piperazine carbamates can achieve meaningful brain access.",
